	And I set the index pagination to "75" items per page
	Then I should be able to view an account on the provisioning index with the name "Korsea - ${staticProjectName}" and the following values
	| Name    | Korsea - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Code    | SEAKORKORSEA                  |
	| Partner | Korsearch Partner             |
	| Region  | United States                 |
	| SLA     | Platinum                      |
	| Tier    | T4                            |
	| State   | ACTIVE                        |

